{
  "name": "Follow up with no-shows from Google Calendar using Twilio and Gmail",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -490,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## No-Show Recovery Sequence (n8n + Twilio)\n\n**Who it's for:** You book appointments, but missed ones often sit in the calendar with no follow-up.\n\n**What it does:** Add \"no-show\" to a missed appointment in Google Calendar. The workflow checks every hour, sends the attendee a new booking link by text and email, and logs the follow-up. It remembers what it already handled, so nobody gets the same message twice.\n\n**How it works:**\n1. A schedule trigger checks the last three hours of your calendar.\n2. Google Calendar returns events that contain your chosen marker word.\n3. Remove Duplicates drops any event the workflow has already handled.\n4. Edit Fields pulls the attendee's email from the event and looks for a phone number in the    description.\n5. Twilio sends the booking link when there is a phone number.\n6. Gmail sends the link either way, and Google Sheets logs the follow-up.\n\n**How to use:**\n- Connect Google Calendar, Twilio, Gmail and Google Sheets.\n- Put your booking link, sending number and marker word in Config.\n- Replace the Sheet ID and pick your calendar.\n- Mark one past event \"no-show\", run it once, then turn it on."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        30,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 430,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "### Setup\nPut your booking link, Twilio number and marker word in **Config (edit me)**. Replace the Sheet ID and pick your calendar, then connect all four accounts."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        490,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 470,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "### 1. Find the appointments you marked\nChecks the last three hours for your marker word. Remove Duplicates remembers past runs, so the same appointment is not handled twice."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        970,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1210,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "### 2. Send a new booking link and log it\nThe attendee gets a text when the event includes a phone number and an email either way. Google Sheets records the follow-up."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Every Hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        60,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Config (edit me)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        260,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "business_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your Business"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "booking_link",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://example.com/book"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "from_number",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "+1234567890"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "marker_word",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "no-show"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "Find Marked Events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "position": [
        520,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "query": "={{ $('Config (edit me)').item.json.marker_word }}",
          "singleEvents": true
        },
        "timeMax": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
        "timeMin": "={{ $now.minus({ hours: 3 }).toISO() }}",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "",
          "cachedResultName": "Pick your calendar"
        },
        "resource": "event",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "Only New No-Shows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "position": [
        760,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "logic": "removeItemsWithAlreadySeenKeyValues",
        "options": {},
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.id }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "name": "Pull Attendee Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1000,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "name": "attendee_email",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.attendees ? ($json.attendees.find(a => !a.organizer) || {}).email : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "b2",
              "name": "attendee_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.attendees ? (($json.attendees.find(a => !a.organizer) || {}).displayName || (($json.attendees.find(a => !a.organizer) || {}).email || '').split('@')[0]) : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "b3",
              "name": "attendee_phone",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ (($json.description || '').match(/\\+?[0-9][0-9\\-\\s().]{7,}[0-9]/) || [''])[0].trim() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "b4",
              "name": "event_title",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.summary }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "b5",
              "name": "event_time",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.start.dateTime }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "name": "Is There a Phone Number?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1240,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 1,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.attendee_phone }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "name": "Text the Rebooking Link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "position": [
        1500,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "to": "={{ $json.attendee_phone }}",
        "from": "={{ $('Config (edit me)').item.json.from_number }}",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json.attendee_name }}, sorry we missed you today. You can pick another time here: {{ $('Config (edit me)').item.json.booking_link }}",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sms",
        "operation": "send",
        "toWhatsapp": false
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "name": "Email the Rebooking Link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "position": [
        1740,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Pull Attendee Details').item.json.attendee_email }}",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Pull Attendee Details').item.json.attendee_name }},\n\nSorry we missed you for {{ $('Pull Attendee Details').item.json.event_title }}.\n\nYou can pick another time here:\n{{ $('Config (edit me)').item.json.booking_link }}\n\nSpeak soon.",
        "options": {},
        "subject": "=Sorry we missed you. Pick another time",
        "emailType": "text"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "name": "Log the Recovery",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        1980,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "name": "={{ $('Pull Attendee Details').item.json.attendee_name }}",
            "email": "={{ $('Pull Attendee Details').item.json.attendee_email }}",
            "phone": "={{ $('Pull Attendee Details').item.json.attendee_phone }}",
            "channels": "={{ $('Pull Attendee Details').item.json.attendee_phone ? 'SMS + Email' : 'Email' }}",
            "contacted_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "original_time": "={{ $('Pull Attendee Details').item.json.event_time }}",
            "missed_appointment": "={{ $('Pull Attendee Details').item.json.event_title }}"
          },
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow"
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "No-shows",
          "cachedResultName": "No-shows"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.7
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
